(d) "Location" means a business within the City that has complied with the provisions of the ordinances of the City relating to occupation taxes and business licenses and refers to the entire office or area of the business in any one (1) location owned or leased by the same proprietor or proprietors where the lessor or lessors allow the space to be used for business purposes.
(e) "Location owner" or "location operator" means an owner or operator of a business where one (1) or more bona fide coin operated amusement machines are available for commercial use and play by the public, or it shall have the same definition as found in O.C.G.A § 50-27-70, as amended, should that definition differ.
(Ord. No. 2023-14, § 3, 2-15-23)

